        "description": "__Species:__ Demigod\n\nGöll is the youngest of the 13 Valkyrie Sisters and the deuteragonist of the series. During the Ragnarok matches, she is usually seen with Brunhilde anxiously watching each match.\n\nShe's usually anxious and worried about many things to the point that it gets on Brunhilde's and Hrist's nerves. Whenever humanity's warriors die, she cries and mourns each of her sisters as they die with them.\nAs an apprentice valkyrie, she doesn't seem all that interested in saving humanity compared to worrying about her sisters.\n",
